[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_POWER_PONIES_COMIC_BOOK]
Power Ponies Comic Book

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_5LG_ARTIFACT_POWER_PONIES_COMIC_BOOK_DESC]
These enchanted comic books are sold in Canterlot stores and are highly praised for their immersive experience.
However, a fun fact that is not often mentioned is that before the bookstore started selling them, these magic comics used to be part of the library’s collection - the problem was, the return rate was extremely low.

